                "prompt": "This code wants to pick the K most similar chunks, but unrelated chunks come back.\n\n```\ndef en_iyi(parcalar, k):\n    sirali = sorted(parcalar, key=lambda p: p.skor)\n    return sirali[:k]\n```\n\nWhat is the bug?",
